Package: ALAQUER
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Language AI Query User Experience in R
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("ALAQUER", "Developer", email = "alaquer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A cutting-edge R package and RStudio addin that provides a
    sophisticated ChatGPT-style Shiny interface for interacting with Ollama
    language models. Version 3.0 features: Performance optimization with intelligent
    caching and parallel processing, multi-agent workflows for collaborative AI,
    comprehensive analytics and insights dashboard, extensible plugin architecture,
    advanced RAG with vector embeddings and hybrid search, workflow automation and
    task scheduling, comprehensive testing suite, plus all v2.0 features including
    streaming responses, conversation management, multi-model comparison, theme
    system, session persistence, advanced export formats, model management, response
    quality tracking, Super RAG, online search integration, AI-powered prompt
    engineering, and advanced response processing.
